

Selenium WebDriver
===================================
Selenium WebDriver is an API for WebUi automation test

Selenium WebDriver is an interface through which we can automate any web application

Features
===========
-Automate web application
-Support multiple browser
-support multiple platform(windows/linux/mac)
-Support multiple programming language
-Integrate selenium with other open source framework
-This is open source and free tool
-Mobile app testing with different api(Appium)

Limitations
=====================
- Window application we can not automate using selenium
- Automation for image like bar code reader,otp automation,captcha not possible with selenium



