Selenium Exception
------------------------
1.InvalidArgumentException: invalid argument
When we provide incomplete url then this exception throws by Selenium
Note: Every url should be pass with protocol





WebDriver Browser Commands/Methods
----------------------------------------
1.get(url): Open application within browser
2.getTitle(): returns String title of the current page
3.getCurrentUrl(): Returns string current page Url
4.getPageSource(): to get the page source
5.close():close the current active session
6.quit(): close all the sessions which opens through selenium

Window Handling
-----------------------
6.getWindowHandle():returns string as Current window Id
7.getWindowHandles():returns Set<String> to get all open windows id

============================================================
WebDriver Navigation commands/Methods
------------------------------------------
Selenium WebDriver provided Navigation interface which has methods
to navigate in between application or pages

navigate() returns Navigation interface object

1.to(url):In Same browserSession to navigate other application we use to(url)
-----------------------------
driver.navigate().to(url)

2.back()
-------------------
driver.navigate().back()

3.forward()
------------------
driver.navigate().forward()

4.refresh()
-------------------
driver.navigate().refresh()

